---
layout: base.njk
title: "Inner Circle"
description: "Join the Trenches Mentality Inner Circle: tailored webinars, exclusive guides and inside interviews for people serious about making it out."
permalink: /inner-circle/
---
{%- set ic = innerCircle %}
<section class="ic-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--maize)">Inner Circle · Members only</p>
    <h1>For the ones who are serious about getting out.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The blog is free and always will be. The Inner Circle is where we go deeper: live webinars built around your goals, full playbooks, and honest interviews with people who have done it.</p>
    <div class="price-tag">
      <span class="price">MWK {{ ic.priceMwk }}</span>
      <span class="per">/ {{ ic.period }}</span>
      <span class="alt">or ${{ ic.priceUsd }} in crypto</span>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="#join-ic" style="background:var(--maize);border-color:var(--maize);color:var(--ink)">Join the Inner Circle</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What members get</h2>
    <div class="perks">
      {%- for p in ic.perks %}
      <div class="perk">
        <span class="num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.line }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section ic-join" id="join-ic">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>How to join</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:38rem">Two steps. Pay with the method that works for you, then send us your payment reference so we can add you.</p>

    {%- if not ic.open %}
    <div class="pay-card" style="margin-top:1.5rem"><h3>Doors are closed for now.</h3><p>We open new spots in small batches so every member gets attention. <a href="/newsletter/">Join the Sunday letter</a> and you'll hear first when we reopen.</p></div>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <p class="step-num">Step 1 · Pay</p>
        <div class="pay-options">
          <div class="pay-card">
            <h3>Mobile money or card</h3>
            <p>Airtel Money, TNM Mpamba, bank or card through PayChangu. MWK {{ ic.priceMwk }}.</p>
            {%- if ic.paychanguLink %}
            <a class="btn" href="{{ ic.paychanguLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pay with PayChangu</a>
            {%- else %}
            <span class="btn btn-disabled" aria-disabled="true">PayChangu coming soon</span>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="pay-card">
            <h3>Crypto</h3>
            <p>${{ ic.priceUsd }} in USDT, BTC, ETH or 300+ other coins through NOWPayments. After paying, copy the <strong>Payment ID</strong> for step 2.</p>
            {%- if ic.cryptoLink %}
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ ic.cryptoLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pay with crypto</a>
            {%- else %}
            <span class="btn btn-disabled" aria-disabled="true">Crypto coming soon</span>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <p class="step-num">Step 2 · Claim your spot</p>
        <form name="inner-circle" method="POST" action="/thanks/?f=inner-circle" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="inner-circle">
          <p class="hidden"><label>Leave this empty <input name="company"></label></p>
          <div class="field"><label for="ic-name">Your name</label><input id="ic-name" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="ic-email">Email</label><input id="ic-email" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="ic-wa">WhatsApp number (for the invite)</label><input id="ic-wa" type="text" name="whatsapp" required placeholder="+265 ..." autocomplete="tel"></div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="ic-method">How did you pay?</label>
            <select id="ic-method" name="method">
              <option>PayChangu (mobile money / card)</option>
              <option>Crypto</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field"><label for="ic-ref">Payment reference (PayChangu) or Payment ID (NOWPayments)</label><input id="ic-ref" type="text" name="reference" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="ic-goal">What are you working on right now? (helps us shape the webinars)</label><textarea id="ic-goal" name="goal" rows="3"></textarea></div>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Claim my spot</button>
          <p class="meta" style="margin-top:.8rem">We check every payment by hand and send your invite within 24 hours.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:44rem">
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <ul class="values">
      <li><strong>Is it a monthly payment?</strong>Yes. Membership runs one month from the day you join. We'll remind you a few days before it ends so you can renew.</li>
      <li><strong>Can I leave?</strong>Anytime. Just don't renew. No contracts, no hard feelings.</li>
      <li><strong>Is the blog still free?</strong>Always. The Inner Circle is for people who want more depth and direct access.</li>
      <li><strong>Something went wrong with my payment?</strong><a href="/contact/">Message us</a> with your reference and we'll sort it out.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
